art of the pandemic, we did look at it as we came through this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/06/paylocity-holding-pcty-q3-2022-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"PCTY 2022 Q3","e":"pcty","d":"2022-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Beauchamp","x":"…you think about that, that was really a technology acquisition that's going to allow us to really streamline the ability to integrate with third-party applications, which is something that we already do today, but it's a low-code kind of no-code environment where you can do that via…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/06/paylocity-holding-pcty-q3-2022-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q2","e":"pcty","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Toby Williams","x":"As highlighted last quarter, in addition to embedding AI capabilities within our product suite, we are also investing in AI and broader automation efforts internally to help drive greater efficiency and productivity across our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/paylocity-pcty-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q2","e":"pcty","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ryan Glenn","x":"We remain focused on driving leverage by improved operational scale and through improved efficiencies resulting from our ongoing investments in automation and AI across our business, which are helping us scale our team and providing the ability to focus on more strategic work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/paylocity-pcty-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q2","e":"pcty","d":"2026-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Samad Samana","x":"Just as I think about the pricing environment, we've seen, you know, with different software vendors either raising prices, especially over the last couple of years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/paylocity-pcty-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q2","e":"pcty","d":"2026-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Samad Samana","x":"I know price increases are just a normal course of business, but how are you seeing customer reaction on renewal to either increases and or reduction of discounts?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/paylocity-pcty-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q2","e":"pcty","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Sitikantha Panigrahi","x":"More layoffs coming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/paylocity-pcty-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q2","e":"pcty","d":"2026-02-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steven Beauchamp","x":"…have continued to embed across the platform, also contributed to our strong financial results and increased guidance, including the recent release of our policy and procedures agent, which enables clients to leverage their own internal documentation, such as employee handbooks and standard…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/paylocity-pcty-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q2","e":"pcty","d":"2026-02-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Toby Williams","x":"Overall, we are pleased with our Q2 results and believe we are well-positioned heading into the back half of the year, as reflected in our increased guidance for fiscal 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/paylocity-pcty-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q3","e":"pcty","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Steven Beauchamp","x":"A critical component driving our product strategy is the continued investment in embedding AI across our platform, such that AI capabilities are woven in, not bolted on and enabling the evolution from AI assistant to AI agents.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/paylocity-pcty-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q3","e":"pcty","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Steven Beauchamp","x":"Alongside our investment in AI, we are also enhancing the strength and breadth of our platform, highlighted by the recent launch of Paylocity Elevate solutions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/paylocity-pcty-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q3","e":"pcty","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steven Beauchamp","x":"They're going to pass that on to typically an internal person with much level of expertise, and they'll take that product SKU from initial discovery through to sale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/paylocity-pcty-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q3","e":"pcty","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven Beauchamp","x":"With offerings across implementation, payroll and HR, Paylocity Elevate solution helps clients streamline these core work streams, lighten administrative workload for internal teams and enables them to focus more time on strategic priorities while delivering measurable efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/paylocity-pcty-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q3","e":"pcty","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kevin McVeigh","x":"Is there going to be a shift in terms of the revenue, just given the efficiencies because it sounds like there's a pretty meaningful amount of cost savings for the client in addition to yourself?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/paylocity-pcty-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q3","e":"pcty","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steven Beauchamp","x":"The momentum we saw in the first half of the year continued into Q3, which included a strong selling season performance by our sales and operation teams and helped to drive 11.6% recurring and other revenue growth in the quarter and increased guidance for fiscal '26.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/paylocity-pcty-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q3","e":"pcty","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ryan Glenn","x":"As far as what that means for the fourth quarter, I think there's always a timing element there as you look at the increased guidance for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/paylocity-pcty-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q4","e":"pcty","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ryan Glenn","x":"Specific to '27, I think we're in a period where we're absolutely investing in AI, specifically with Ignite AI, which both Steve and Toby talked about in their prepared remarks, seeing really nice momentum there, a number of new product releases between Paylocity Retirement, Elevate Solutions,…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/paylocity-pcty-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q4","e":"pcty","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Allan M. Verkhovski","x":"Given your comments about confidence in your ability to scale as you continue investing in AI capabilities across the platform, can you go a touch deeper in what gives you conviction that gross margins can improve from roughly 75% today to the 80% plus target you outlined at $3 billion in revenue?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/paylocity-pcty-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q4","e":"pcty","d":"2026-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jordan Boretz","x":"Could that be broader price increases?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/paylocity-pcty-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q4","e":"pcty","d":"2026-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ryan Glenn","x":"So when you combine natural scale pricing power, I think, with some of the third-party vendors as well and then you layer on the AI and automation, I think that gives us the confidence that on a multi-year basis, the 80% plus increased gross margin target we have is the right one.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/paylocity-pcty-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2026 Q4","e":"pcty","d":"2026-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ryan Glenn","x":"And our hope and expectation would be if we continue to see that strong performance, we would be able to exceed our guidance and raise the guidance, both from a revenue and margin standpoint as we go throughout the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/paylocity-pcty-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2027 Q1","e":"pcty","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ryan Glenn","x":"…by improved operational scale and through improved efficiencies resulting from our ongoing investments in automation and AI across our business, which are helping us scale our teams and providing the ability to focus on more strategic work, which ultimately is helping to drive increased…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/07/paylocity-pcty-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2027 Q1","e":"pcty","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Toby Williams","x":"At Elevate, we highlighted our continued commitment to investing in our differentiated strategy of embedding AI into the everyday flow of work across our HCM, finance and IT products through the recent launch of Paylocity Ignite AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/07/paylocity-pcty-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCTY 2027 Q1","e":"pcty","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Marcon","x":"And are there any pass-through costs that we have to be aware of or anything along those lines?","u